    "body": "> Interestingly, in Firefox `new URL('https://a\\u0007f.com')` \r\n\r\nThat's because that is equivalent to:\r\n`new URL(\"https://a\" + String.fromCodePoint(0x07) + \"f.com\")` 🙂\r\n\r\n",
