    "updated_at": "2021-10-21T07:48:34Z",
    "body": "As pointed out by @achristensen07 in the WebKit bug one problem here might be non-special URLs.\r\n\r\nI suspect we might not want to have things result in failure there as that would end up with things throwing that currently do not throw in either Chrome or Firefox.\r\n\r\nThat would be a further argument to fix #319 and probably have two separate constants. Thoughts? Anyone up for fixing this in the spec?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
